accel-virt: ID3D12Device13::OpenExistingHeapFromAddress1, natively too, and as a C
export (vkd3d_proton_open_heap_from_host_pointer) for an embedder whose headers
predate ID3D12Device13: the executor imports guest memory as upload and readback
heaps through it. A failed host import fails rather than falling back to memory
the caller never sees.

